    ["<Assistant_Title1>【总有明天】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工厂区又一次发生了命案。一位女士因目击案件而崩溃哭泣，负责案件的警官认出你是调查特殊案件的专家，请求你帮忙安抚证人。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1050,1200)]|4930;20236;-1942;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【There Is Always Tomorrow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Another murder has occurred in the factory district. A lady is crying uncontrollably after witnessing the case. The officer in charge recognizes you as an expert in investigating special cases and asks for your help to pacify the witness.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1050,1200)]|4930;20236;-1942;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>哑光布艺・细密针织・休闲漫步装\n愿你和那位存在一样，在这座学识之都度过旅行开端最好的时光。"] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Matte Fabric, Fine Knitting & Leisure Stroll Outfit\nMay you, like that existence, spend the best moments at the start of your journey in this city of knowledge.",
    ["<Highlight>【灵界焕容】</>\n触及美，焕发美，成为美之本我，世间美的奇迹。\n\n<Highlight>【召唤规则】</>\n使用圣杯进行灵界召唤，概率获得珍贵的宝物奖励。\n奖励分为<Highlight>神眷</>、<Highlight>灵幻</>、<Highlight>非凡</>三档。累计使用<Highlight>60</>个圣杯且未获得神眷奖励后，神眷概率逐渐增加，每使用<Highlight>140个</>圣杯必定获得<Highlight>神眷</>奖励，每使用<Highlight>10个</>圣杯必定获得<Highlight>灵幻或灵幻以上</>品质的奖励。\n其中，圣杯·绑的使用次数将独立计算，使用圣杯·绑进行召唤获得的奖励无法交易或赠送。\n\n<Highlight>【其它规则】</>\n使用<Highlight>神眷牌</>可以在美神馈赠商店兑换<Highlight>神眷</>奖励。\n使用<Highlight>灵幻牌</>可在灵幻祭坛商店兑换奖励，获得超过拥有上限的灵幻档次外观奖励时，将会被分解为特定数量的<Highlight>灵幻牌</>。\n勾选使用<Highlight>圣杯</>抵扣<Highlight>圣杯·绑</>进行召唤后，使用圣杯进行召唤获得的奖励将<Highlight>无法交易或赠送</>，并计入圣杯·绑保底进度。\n\n<Highlight>【概率公示】</>\n神眷奖励概率（含保底）：0.873%\n<Highlight>神眷牌</>：0.793%\n<Highlight>金枝森影</>：0.080%\n\n灵幻奖励概率（含保底）：10.928%\n星映绿夜·上装、星映绿夜·下装、星映绿夜·饰品、星映绿夜·配饰、颂诗礼服·发型、颂诗礼服·上装、颂诗礼服·下装、颂诗礼服·饰品、花开半靥、幽灵船舵、时之钟、灵幻牌*10、灵幻牌*5\n\n非凡奖励概率（含保底）：88.199%\n灵幻牌、聚合因子、泡沫染膏、珊瑚染料、爆爆烟花、彩带烟花、派对烟花、古怪的药剂、简易的火把、纯情鲁特琴、小象玩偶、冰冷的裹布、荣耀的传承、卷毛狒狒的毛发、幸运大转盘、贝壳项链、珍珠胸花"] = "<Highlight>【Spirit World Rejuvenation】</>\nTouch beauty, radiate beauty, become the true self of beauty, a miracle of beauty in this world.\n\n<Highlight>【Summoning Rules】</>\nUse Holy Cups to perform Spirit World summoning for a chance to obtain precious treasure rewards.\nRewards are divided into three tiers: <Highlight>God's Favor</>, <Highlight>Spirit Illusion</>, and <Highlight>Beyonder</>. After using a total of <Highlight>60</> Holy Cups without obtaining a God's Favor reward, the probability of obtaining one will gradually increase. Every <Highlight>140</> Holy Cups used guarantees a <Highlight>God's Favor</> reward, and every <Highlight>10</> Holy Cups used guarantees a reward of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion or higher</> quality.\n Note that the usage count for Bound Holy Cups is calculated independently, and rewards obtained using Bound Holy Cups cannot be traded or gifted.\n\n<Highlight>【Other Rules】</>\nUse <Highlight>God's Favor Cards</> to exchange for <Highlight>God's Favor</> rewards in the Goddess's Gift Shop.\nUse <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</> to exchange for rewards in the Spirit Illusion Altar Shop. If you obtain a Spirit Illusion tier cosmetic reward that exceeds your ownership limit, it will be decomposed into a specific number of <Highlight>Spirit Illusion Cards</>.\nIf you check the option to use <Highlight>Holy Cups</> to offset <Highlight>Bound Holy Cups</> for summoning, the rewards obtained will be <Highlight>untradeable and ungiftable</>, and will count towards the pity progress for Bound Holy Cups.\n\n<Highlight>【Probability Disclosure】</>\nGod's Favor reward probability (including pity): 0.873%\n<Highlight>God's Favor Card</>: 0.793%\n<Highlight>Golden Branch Forest Shadow</>: 0.080%\n\nSpirit Illusion reward probability (including pity): 10.928%\nStar-Reflected Green Night Top, Star-Reflected Green Night Bottom, Star-Reflected Green Night Accessory, Star-Reflected Green Night Ornament, Hymn Dress Hairstyle, Hymn Dress Top, Hymn Dress Bottom, Hymn Dress Accessory, Half-Face Bloom, Ghost Ship Rudder, Clock of Time, Spirit Illusion Card*10, Spirit Illusion Card*5\n\nBeyonder reward probability (including pity): 88.199%\nSpirit Illusion Card, Aggregation Factor, Foam Dye, Coral Dye, Pop Fireworks, Ribbon Fireworks, Party Fireworks, Eccentric Potion, Simple Torch, Innocent Lute, Elephant Doll, Cold Shroud, Glorious Inheritance, Curly-Haired Baboon Hair, Lucky Big Wheel, Seashell Necklace, Pearl Corsage",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾色锦缎・晨露缀饰・清雅礼服\n清晨雾霭之中，有精灵留下踪迹。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Mist-colored Brocade, Morning Dew Embellishments, & Elegant Gown\nAmidst the morning mist, spirits have left their traces.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86063020\" color=\"#f4a067\">凋零之刃</>每次命中后对目标附加<HighLight>减速</>，并在使用后每<HighLight>2</>秒获得<HighLight>1</>枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>，持续6秒。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\">巨剑斩击</>对命中目标打断0.5秒，输出形态下对敌人附加2秒沉默，并且额外加6秒<HighLight>衰败</>，对<HighLight>衰败</>状态的敌方造成的伤害增加<HighLight>10%</>。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86063020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Blade of Withering </> applies <HighLight> Slow </> to targets on each hit and grants <HighLight> 2 </> <HighLight> 1 </> <HighLight> Twilight Mark </> every 2 seconds for 6 seconds after use. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86061110\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Greatsword Slash </> interrupts targets for 0.5 seconds. In Offensive Stance, it applies 2 seconds of Silence to enemies, adds 6 seconds of <HighLight> Decay </>, and increases damage against enemies in the <HighLight> Decay </> state by <HighLight> 10% </>.",
